WEBVTT

00:07:28.072 --> 00:07:30.154
already marked where I had to sign.

00:07:30.154 --> 00:07:32.098
And with the labor pain,

00:07:32.098 --> 00:07:39.168
I didn't have the strength to ask them to read it to me.

00:07:39.168 --> 00:07:41.697
I just signed.

00:07:41.712 --> 00:07:44.850
SE: Hilma and Nick and our man in the kingdom

00:07:44.850 --> 00:07:49.201
are among the 34 million people living with HIV

00:07:49.201 --> 00:07:51.317
according to recent estimates.

00:07:51.317 --> 00:07:53.185
They're the lucky ones

00:07:53.185 --> 00:07:54.869
because they're still alive.

00:07:54.869 --> 00:07:56.734
According to those same estimates,

00:07:56.734 --> 00:08:00.718
in 2010 1.8 million people died